<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Details of Czech 1996 balance of payments - c.bank.</title>
<headline>Details of Czech 1996 balance of payments - c.bank.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of the Czech balance of payments as released by the Czech centrla bank on Tuesday. (all figures in millions of USD)</p>
<p>				    FY 1996    Q1-Q3/96     FY 1995</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT ($ mln)   -4,475.8    -3,082.7    -1,588.5</p>
<p>   Trade Balance	     -5,971.8    -4,118.4    -3,955.6</p>
<p>     -exports		  21,702.5    16,061.9    14,916.5</p>
<p>     -imports		  27,674.3    20,180.3    18,872.1</p>
<p>   Balance of Services	1,785.0     1,129.1     1,852.2</p>
<p>     revenues		   7,951.5     5,540.3     6,180.0</p>
<p>	transport		 1,320.7	 951.6     1,445.8</p>
<p>	tourism		   4,075.2     2,796.9     2,875.0</p>
<p>	other services	  2,555.6     1,791.8     1,859.2</p>
<p>     expenditure		6,166.5     4,411.2     4,327.8</p>
<p>	transport		   696.5	 506.8	 773.8</p>
<p>	tourism		   2,953.4     2,025.3     1,630.0</p>
<p>	other services	  2,516.6     1,879.1     1,924.0</p>
<p>   Balance of income	   -679.9	-483.1	 -94.5</p>
<p>	credit		    1,198.2	 895.0     1,145.3</p>
<p>	debit		     1,878.1     1,378.1     1,239.8</p>
<p>   Unrequitted transfers	390.0	 389.7	 609.4</p>
<p> CAPITAL ACCOUNT		4,071.7     2,023.2     7,686.8</p>
<p>   Direct investment	  1,387.9	 946.6     2,526.1</p>
<p>    Czech invest. abroad	-40.5	 -25.8	 -32.4</p>
<p>    Foreign invest in CR    1,428.4	 972.4     2,558.5</p>
